#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_app.rst:309
msgid ""
"SuiteCRM is now ready for its initial setup. In a web browser, go to "
"`http://<YOUR_APP_NODE_IP>/install.php`. You should see the license "
"agreement page and can proceed with the setup steps. SuiteCRM is now up "
